	(text "LED_POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.208 49.784 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "968c31eb-0bbc-4f01-991e-765bb672f7f7")
	)
	(text "CONSTRAINTS\n\n1. The power LED follows the 3.3 V rail and has no MCU pin. The\n   other two are driven by GPIO, active high, about 1.2 mA each.\n\n2. On the LED symbol, pin 1 is the cathode and pin 2 is the anode.\n   Reversed, the LED simply never lights and ERC reports nothing.\n\n3. R503 is 330 ohm, not 1k, because D503 is blue. A blue LED drops\n   close to 3 V, which leaves almost nothing across a 1k resistor\n   on a 3.3 V rail. Choose a blue part with forward voltage at or\n   below 3.0 V at low current, and read the spec at 1 to 2 mA\n   rather than the headline 20 mA figure.\n\n4. The trigger is active low. The 10k holds the line high and the\n   button pulls it to ground. R504 with C501 gives about 1 ms of\n   debounce. C501 is optional and may be left unfitted if debounce\n   is done in firmware.\n\n5. TRIG sits on PA0, which is EXTI line 0, and EXTI0 already\n   belongs to CNVR_A on PB0. The trigger must be polled in\n   firmware. Putting it on an interrupt would stop channel A\n   conversion ready edges from arriving, and nothing in the tools\n   would report the conflict.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------\n约束\n\n1. 电源指示灯跟随 3.3 V 电源轨，不占 MCU 引脚。另外两个由 GPIO 驱\n   动，高电平点亮，每个约 1.2 mA。\n\n2. 在 LED 符号上，引脚 1 是阴极，引脚 2 是阳极。接反了 LED 根本不\n   亮，而 ERC 什么都不会报。\n\n3. R503 是 330 欧，不是 1k，因为 D503 是蓝色的。蓝色 LED 的正向压降\n   接近 3 V，在 3.3 V 电源轨上用 1k 电阻几乎分不到电压。请选正向压\n   降在 3.0 V 及以下的蓝色器件，并且要看 1 到 2 mA 条件下的参数，\n   不要看首页上 20 mA 的那个数字。\n\n4. 触发按键是低电平有效。10k 把线拉高，按下时按键把它拉到地。R504\n   配 C501 提供大约 1 ms 的消抖。C501 是可选的，如果消抖放在固件里\n   做，可以不贴。\n\n5. TRIG 在 PA0 上，也就是 EXTI 第 0 号线，而 EXTI0 已经被 PB0 上的\n   CNVR_A 占用。触发按键必须在固件里用轮询方式读取。把它挂到中断上\n   会让通道 A 的转换就绪边沿收不到，而且任何工具都不会报出这个冲突。"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 181.864 88.9 0)
